  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。充滿愛意製作。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>《Healing Soup》對我來說是一款充滿懷舊情懷的模組。我在十多年前開始遊玩多人版 Minecraft，並在 mcpvp 伺服器上投入了大量時間。這個模組實際上是基於原作者 hclewk 曾經分享的原始碼改寫而成，以適配 Forge 平台。食用蘑菇湯（早期版本稱為蘑菇濃湯）可以恢復 4 顆心，當然你也可以在設定檔中調高或調低此數值。當生命值欄滿時，它也會同時填滿飢餓度欄位，但不會增加飽食度。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>soupHalfHeartHealAmount</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 8，最小值 0，最大值 20<br>蘑菇湯/蘑菇濃湯應恢復的半顆心數量。Minecraft PvP 的預設值為 8。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>將預設的蘑菇湯（Mushroom Stew）重新命名為蘑菇濃湯（Mushroom Soup）：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/healing-soup/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"581\" height=\"274\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>新增仙人掌湯食譜與材質：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/healing-soup/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"581\" height=\"274\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>新增巧克力牛奶食譜與材質：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/healing-soup/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"581\" height=\"274\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可自由在任何模組包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a> 反饋。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
